{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Forty.</b> Because he transgressed the Torah that was given over forty days, he receives forty lashes and goes free from his punishment." "<b>He shall strike him.</b> And not upon his garment. And where does he receive lashes? Between his shoulders." "<b>He shall not add.</b> But was it not already stated, לא תוסיפו על הדבר ולא תגרעו ממנו? If so, why did it return and say <b>he shall not add</b>? To tell you that the sages are not authorized to add, but to subtract, the authority is in their hands. Therefore Scripture established the matter at lashes that divide evenly into thirds."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:54:12.095068445Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}